{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12216180","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12216180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1221618001:0":{"text":"あいつら、入口でずっと喚き続けるから、怖くて……一体何の用だったんだ……？","source_cn":"刚才那帮兄弟在门口喊了半天，我也不敢出来。他们是来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0E57D034D1CC02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1221618001":{"text":"あいつら、入口でずっと喚き続けるから、怖くて……一体何の用だったんだ……？","source_cn":"刚才那帮兄弟在门口喊了半天，我也不敢出来。他们是来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0E57D034D1CC02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221618002:0":{"text":"ええ！？一休みしただけだろ……毎日毎日どれだけ働いてると……","source_cn":"啊？不是吧！我就是稍微休息了一会……毕竟每天那么多活儿……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF428725BC28A45CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ええ！？一休みしただけだろ……毎日毎日どれだけ働いてると……","female":"ええ！？一休みしただけだろ……毎日毎日どれだけ働いてると……","variant_male_record_index":"135678","variant_female_record_index":"135679","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221618003:0":{"text":"「一休み」だと？今日一日、どこをほっつき歩いてた？こういうときだけビビりやがって！","source_cn":"“休息一会”？我可是一天都没看见你干活！现在知道害怕了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4994DFE8C3FED302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221618006:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい……","source_cn":"对不起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70674F1F12A00478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221618007:0":{"text":"いや、あいつらに今日の仕事ぶりを褒められたんだよ。よくやったってな。","source_cn":"其实，他们刚刚是在夸我们，说我们今天的工作很出色。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE89C4FD2069802","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221618008:0":{"text":"よくやった？ぼ、僕たち……褒められたの？","source_cn":"工作出色？我们……我们被表扬了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2572B4D959EC18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221618009:0":{"text":"実際に仕事したのはお前たちじゃないけどな。でもまあ、そういうことだ。俺たち雑務係が初めて褒められたぞ！","source_cn":"虽然干活的人不是你们……但没错，咱们勤务工被表扬了！这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B22ECF5A7F8003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221618010:1":{"text":"しかも、皆さんの給料を上げるよう検討するそうですよ！それに二度と怒鳴ったりもしないそうです！","source_cn":"他们打算帮你们争取更多的工钱。对了，还说不会再对你们呼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF8F8C7C8A72B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1221618011:0":{"text":"……良かったあ！そもそもおいらたちがサボってたのだって、頑張って働いても給料は低いし、怒られるしで……","source_cn":"……太好了！我们偷懒，还不是因为又累又没钱，干不好还会被骂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x092EC8B0A06894D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1221618012:0":{"text":"そうそう。みんなが僕たちの苦労を分かってくれるなら、少しはやり甲斐もあるんだけどね……","source_cn":"对啊，要是大家能看到我们的辛苦，我们也不会一点干劲都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA01EBFD83591601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1221618012":{"text":"そうそう。みんなが僕たちの苦労を分かってくれるなら、少しはやり甲斐もあるんだけどね……","source_cn":"对啊，要是大家能看到我们的辛苦，我们也不会一点干劲都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA01EBFD83591601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1221618013:0":{"text":"ああ、これからは仕事に精が出るってもんだ！","source_cn":"是啊，以后的日子可有盼头多了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x71B9E5156382E3EB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ああ、これからは仕事に精が出るってもんだ！","female":"ああ、これからは仕事に精が出るってもんだ！","variant_male_record_index":"135691","variant_female_record_index":"135692","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1221618014:0":{"text":"そうだ、さっきから聞きたかったんだけど、この人たちは？お客さん？","source_cn":"对了，我刚才就想问，他们几个是谁，是我们的客人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938FC6210906A4AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1221618015:0":{"text":"何を言ってるんだ、新しく入った雑務係だろうが！","source_cn":"他们？他们是新来的勤务工啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7826F26CD37744C","variant_status":"","male":"","f